        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By combining brand strength and core retail competencies, including a broad physical footprint in population dense areas across the country, with proprietary technologies and partnerships, our business provides unique, value-added healthcare services to our customers with scale, customization, and cross-network effects that we believe few other companies in the industry can emulate.",
        "start_character": 9578,
        "end_character": 9963
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-005850",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-005850-4acb88b9d1a9ef64",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-005850",
        "filing_date": "2025-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, we do not market or provide massage, finger pressure, acupuncture, moxa-cauterization or other services regulated under this Act, and this information is clearly provided to all customers prior to them receiving our salon services.",
        "start_character": 108207,
        "end_character": 108447
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-005850",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-005850-4acb88b9d1a9ef64",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-005850",
        "filing_date": "2025-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In July 2021, in order to speed up the decision-making process, improve business efficiency, and maximize business value, we reorganized and re-designated certain parts of our wholly-owned subsidiaries by business function.",
        "start_character": 3115,
        "end_character": 3338
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-005850",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-005850-4acb88b9d1a9ef64",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-005850",
        "filing_date": "2025-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to the Specific Health Guidance Program, we provide similar services to younger generations as well.",
        "start_character": 42654,
        "end_character": 42766
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-005850",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-005850-4acb88b9d1a9ef64",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-005850",
        "filing_date": "2025-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we have implemented a remedial measure for the static electricity issue that does not require changing the design architecture of the affected products, and we will prioritize marketing these products towards spa facilities and factories, where the static electricity issue does not arise, until we fully resolve this issue in the next generation of MOTHER Bracelet®, which is currently in development.",
        "start_character": 48884,
        "end_character": 49299
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-005850",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-005850-4acb88b9d1a9ef64",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-005850",
        "filing_date": "2025-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the fourth quarter of 2021, we started an additional business model where we sell our directly-owned salons to investors and enter into service agreements to manage the operations on behalf of the investors.",
        "start_character": 64941,
        "end_character": 65151
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-005850",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-005850-4acb88b9d1a9ef64",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-005850",
        "filing_date": "2025-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provided lifestyle improvement programs via Lav® for people under 40 years of age, and have entered into service agreements with 20 corporate insurance associations as of December 31, 2024.",
        "start_character": 47170,
        "end_character": 47367
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-005850",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001558370-25-005850-4acb88b9d1a9ef64",
        "accession_number": "0001558370-25-005850",
        "filing_date": "2025-04-29",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are one of the leading holistic health services providers in Japan.",
        "start_character": 9024,
        "end_character": 9094
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001558370-25-005850",
